description: "Create, bring up, or debug a native Xbox 360 static recompilation for Linux using a guest-to-C++ translator and runtime. Covers executable analysis, code generation, SDK ABI, graphics, audio, storage, input, and evidence-based validation. Use for native port development, not emulator configuration or a generic Linux game build."
